Package: dqguard
Type: Package
Title: Explicit Data Quality Contracts and Evidence-Based Resolution
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("DQGuard", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Evaluates data quality contracts with row-level findings,
    schema and relational checks, survey integrity diagnostics, issue workflows,
    and generic reference catalogues. This public variant contains the reusable
    validation core.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: digest, jsonlite, stats, utils, tools
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), yaml, xml2, DBI, RSQLite, sf, validate, pointblank, targets, survey, codetools
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: no
URL: https://github.com/GeoffreyManda/dqguard-public
BugReports: https://github.com/GeoffreyManda/dqguard-public/issues
